  "returns": "\n<p>List of objects representing accounts. Each dictionary contains\n    following fields:</p>\n\n    \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>account_number</b> -\n                    Account number.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>account_owner</b> -\n                    Account owner.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>name</b> -\n                    Account name.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>title_prefix</b> -\n                    Account title prefix.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>faculty</b> -\n                    Faculty owning account.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>currency</b> -\n                    Account currency.;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>swift</b> -\n                    Swift code of the account. Might be null..</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n\n\n    <p><b>Warning:</b> these accounts numbers are related to user faculties and not\n    to payments! They are for informational purposes only!<p>\n    ",
